[[Dante Vale]] stayed some time at the temple when he was a teenager, where he trained everyday with [[Lin Storm]].

Troubled by [[Arc]]'s vision of his death, Dante returned many years later to train in secret and prepare for his fate. [[Master Storm]] taught him the power [[Copykind]], which Dante used soon enough to copy [[Ignatius]]' powers after teleporting away with [[Umbra]] to help his team at the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]]. {{source|Lok's Leadership}}

